<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <main>
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
          <h1>How we help your business</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Here is what TAIG actually does for small, owner-run shops in Jacksonville —
            explained plainly. No jargon, no mystery. Most people start with a free IT checkup.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="service-list">
            <article class="service-card" id="business-refresh">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>Business Operation Refresh</h2></div>
              <p>Your shop's tech, fixed and freshened up. We find what's broken or slowing you down and fix it properly — computers, Wi-Fi, and the network that ties it together. We did it for a local tire shop: computers and network fixed, a dead power supply swapped, a new router in.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card" id="monthly-cover">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>Monthly IT Support</h2></div>
              <p>One simple monthly plan. We keep your computers updated, check your backups actually work, keep the Wi-Fi running, and fix day-to-day problems when they pop up. You get a short report each month in plain words — and if something stops your business, it jumps to the front of the line.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card" id="websites">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>Website Creation &amp; Care</h2></div>
              <p>A website for your business — built, then looked after month to month. We build it, keep it running and updated, so customers find you online and trust what they see.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card" id="social-media">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>Social Media Management</h2></div>
              <p>We watch the numbers and tell you what's working — in plain words. It starts with a free look at what you're doing now, then we fix it up and run it month to month. You approve everything; nothing goes out without your say.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card" id="marketing">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>Marketing &amp; Promotion</h2></div>
              <p>Get found by the people around you. Business cards with a code that takes people straight to your Facebook page, flyers and door hangers for the neighborhood. Every flyer offers a free checkup, so new customers have a reason to call.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card" id="pc-repair-sales">
              <div class="service-card-header"><h2>PC Repair &amp; Sales</h2></div>
              <p>Broken computer? Need a good one? We fix them and sell them — good used laptops and computers at fair prices, run by our partner Mo at Abbar Tech. For anyone who needs their machine working again without the runaround.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section-alt">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <h2>Not sure where to start?</h2>
          <p>
            Start with a free IT checkup. We come out, look at what's going on with your
            computers and network, and tell you plainly what needs fixing. No charge, no pressure.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Conversation</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
